- 2026-10-06 empty layers: RenderLiquidGlassLayer.onTransformChanged
  returns at once while no shape is registered with its link (a package
  stage over a list section without glass): it used to repaint the layer,
  and with it everything up to the nearest repaint boundary, on every
  frame its screen transform moved (a scroll). A shape that registers
  repaints through the layer. Numbers in glass-renderer.md ("List
